{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"sword_short","model_identifier":"sword_short","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## sword_short\n\nOne-handed weapon, bronze.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -2.0..2.0, z -18.5..3.5 (size 1.5 x 4.0 x 22.0 u = 4 x 11 x 62 cm).\nBronze leaf-shaped short sword, about 60 cm (22 u): the blade narrows above the guard and swells to a leaf before the point; simple bar guard. Grip at the origin, point 18.5 u forward (-Z), edges up/down. One-handed. (No bronze longswords, per the brief.)\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `sword_short_bronze.png`\n"},"description":"## sword_short\n\nOne-handed weapon, bronze.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 32x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.8..0.8, y -2.0..2.0, z -18.5..3.5 (size 1.5 x 4.0 x 22.0 u = 4 x 11 x 62 cm).\nBronze leaf-shaped short sword, about 60 cm (22 u): the blade narrows above the guard and swells to a leaf before the point; simple bar guard. Grip at the origin, point 18.5 u forward (-Z), edges up/down. One-handed. (No bronze longswords, per the brief.)\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `sword_short_bronze.png`\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"pommel","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.75,-1.0,2.5],"to":[0.75,1.0,3.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[24,7,25.5,9.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[28,7,29.0,9.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[26,7,27.5,9.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[29,7,30.0,9.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[6,9,7.5,10.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[8,9,9.5,10.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"06df8019-ddfb-5229-a77a-71ebee34